title Parte B - Analytics conversacional

direction right

Usuario [icon: user]

teratrip_analytics_agent [icon: aws-bedrock, color: purple]

teratrip-analytics-gateway [icon: aws-api-gateway, color: purple] {
  teratrip-kb-target [icon: book-open]
  teratrip-athena-target [icon: tool]
}

teratrip-business-kb [icon: aws-bedrock, color: blue] {
  Diccionario de datos [icon: file-text]
  Reglas de negocio [icon: file-text]
  Definicion de metricas [icon: file-text]
  Contexto del dataset [icon: file-text]
}

lambda-teratrip-athena-query [icon: aws-lambda, color: orange] {
  Validacion en 6 capas [icon: shield]
}

Amazon Athena [icon: aws-athena, color: blue]
curated booking_analytics [icon: database, color: green]

// --- Conversacion ---
Usuario > teratrip_analytics_agent: pregunta en lenguaje natural
teratrip_analytics_agent > teratrip-analytics-gateway: IAM / SigV4

// --- Contexto de negocio ---
teratrip-kb-target > teratrip-business-kb: que significa la metrica

// --- Datos ---
teratrip-athena-target > lambda-teratrip-athena-query: execute_athena_query(sql_query)
Validacion en 6 capas > Amazon Athena: solo SELECT sobre booking_analytics
Amazon Athena > curated booking_analytics
Amazon Athena > teratrip_analytics_agent: filas tipadas + QueryExecutionId
teratrip_analytics_agent > Usuario: respuesta citando la cifra
